"# Compatibility\n"
"\n"
"<!-- Generated by `vp run sync:compatibility`. Do not edit by hand; run the "
"writer and commit. -->\n"
"\n"
"This page records the Instructure UI sources this pantoken build resolves "
"from, and which consumers\n"
"use them. Target versions are separate: only verified releases are claimed, "
"and releases newer than\n"
"the last verified release need review. Regenerate it with `vp run "
"sync:compatibility`; the\n"
"`gate:compatibility` check fails if it drifts.\n"
"\n"
"## Upstream sources\n"
